WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.167
-You're a stud.
Welcome, welcome, welcome, bud.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.868
-Thank you very much.
-I'm so happy you're here.

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:06.167
Congrats on
"House of the Dragon."

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:07.267
-Thank you.

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:09.567
-Every episode gets
bigger and bigger.

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.834
You play Ser Criston Cole,

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:13.300
knight of the Kingsguard.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.434
-Correct.

00:00:14.434 --> 00:00:16.868
-Here you are in
full armor right here.

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:19.767
[ Cheers and applause ]
And -- Yeah.

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.901
It looks heavy. Is it heavy?
-It's quite heavy.

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:26.601
I mean, it got less heavy
as time went on.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:27.934
But at the beginning,
it was really --

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:31.400
There was, like --
You had, like, a breastplate,

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.100
which is, like, a thing
that protects your neck

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.400
and, like,
your top of your chest.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.033
But you couldn't remove it.

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:40.767
So, for like the first, like,
2 1/2 weeks of filming,

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:42.968
I had to, like,
sit like a zombie

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:44.601
and have people sort of, like,

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:47.067
feed me like I was very sick.

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.634
-You actually shrank
2 inches that day.

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.667
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.567
-Well, you eventually got to be
pretty comfortable

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:55.067
in the suit of armor,
because we have a photo here

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:57.133
that your co-star took of you.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:59.534
This is you asleep.

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:01.067
-I'm a really ugly sleeper.

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:02.400
It's, like, a real thing.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.267
I see people who sleep really
beautifully. I don't.

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:06.901
-Yes, you --
-I really don't.

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:08.200
-It's pretty perfect
right there.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.501
Did you have any idea Milly
was taking this photo?

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:10.934
-No, I had no idea.

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:14.667
I actually didn't see it until
she put it on social media.

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:16.300
-That's even --
That was my second question.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.667
-Yeah, and now that's it
between us.

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:18.868
-Yeah, now you got to
get her back.

00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:19.968
-Yeah, we're done.

00:01:19.968 --> 00:01:22.534
-Can we talk about
your character?

00:01:22.534 --> 00:01:25.200
Because fan favorite.
We all love you.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.334
And then --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:31.667
Now, the fans --
Some fans have started to

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:32.934
turn on you a little bit.

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:34.300
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.133
-They're not into it anymore.
-Yeah, it's interesting.

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:37.167
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:38.767
-How is it as an actor
to go like,

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:39.834
"Oh, hold on a second.

00:01:39.834 --> 00:01:41.133
Wait, but I'm --"

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.501
-I sort of had inkling
that some people didn't like me.

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:44.801
We went to Comic Con,

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:47.400
and I remember, like,
all the actors lined up.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.200
And I heard a guy go like,
"That guy plays Criston Cole.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.033
I hate that dude."

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:54.000
And I was really confused.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.501
And I was like, "Wow. Already?

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:56.601
It hasn't even come out yet."

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:57.901
-Yeah, the episode
hasn't come out yet

00:01:57.901 --> 00:01:59.033
where you're supposed to
hate me.

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:00.367
-Yeah. Exactly, yeah.

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:01.634
-This part, you're actually
supposed to like me.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:02.901
-Yeah, yeah, yeah. Yeah.

00:02:02.901 --> 00:02:05.434
-And is it tough to have
all these episodes with spoilers

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:07.167
and not telling anyone
what's going on?

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:08.868
-There's HBO people
outside right now.

00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:11.200
-Yeah, I met them all.
Yeah. Dangerous people.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.300
-You don't want to mess
with them.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.534
-No, not at all.

00:02:13.534 --> 00:02:14.868
Yeah, I'm not going to
spoil anything tonight.

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.934
-No, no, no, don't.
-But what happens next episode?

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:19.767
-Yeah, yeah. Good to meet you.
Thank you so much.

00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:22.100
-Nice knowing you.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.167
-Can you say anything
about what's coming up?

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:25.767
How many episodes are left?

00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:29.067
-We did --
Eight came out yesterday?

00:02:29.067 --> 00:02:30.434
-Yeah.
-So two.

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:31.901
-So two more left.
-Yes.

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:35.634
-So Is there -- I'm assuming
something for the last episode?

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:38.100
-There will be a last episode.
Something will happen in it.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.801
-You heard it here first, folks.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:42.801 --> 00:02:44.901
And then, the next episode,

00:02:44.901 --> 00:02:46.367
you can kind of coast
through that one?

00:02:46.367 --> 00:02:47.868
-Yeah, I'm gonna
coast through that one,

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:50.033
and something will happen
in that one, as well.

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:51.801
And then that will be --

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:54.434
-But, see, I have a feeling
you want me to believe that

00:02:54.434 --> 00:02:56.133
because you want me
to coast in there,

00:02:56.133 --> 00:02:58.501
and then something crazy is
gonna happen in that episode.

00:02:58.501 --> 00:03:01.200
-That's exactly what
I'm setting up today.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.634
-Yeah. And then, when you come
back the next time,

00:03:02.634 --> 00:03:03.868
you go, "I'm sorry, Jimmy.

00:03:03.868 --> 00:03:05.501
I couldn't let you know
this happened."

00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:06.767
-That's what it is.

00:03:06.767 --> 00:03:08.400
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:11.334
-So, if you had to choose
between the next episode

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:14.501
and the last,
which one would you watch first?

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:17.868
-The 11th.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:17.868 --> 00:03:20.567
It's a big deal to be part of
a giant show like this.

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:21.767
How does it feel?

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:24.868
Do you get nervous getting cast
or do you get --

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:29.501
-Yeah, I get really nervous
every time I step on set.

00:03:29.501 --> 00:03:31.534
-Do you remember the first time?
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:31.534 --> 00:03:35.200
The very first day we shot,
it was, like, this huge scene.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.767
It was all
the cast members, like,

00:03:37.767 --> 00:03:42.300
Paddy, Rhys, Matt, Liv --
all really good actors.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:44.801
And, like, they were going
close-ups on everyone,

00:03:44.801 --> 00:03:46.801
and everyone was
doing it super-well.

00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:49.968
And it, like,
finally got around to my bit,

00:03:49.968 --> 00:03:52.734
and all I had -- I had one bit
in the whole scene,

00:03:52.734 --> 00:03:54.133
and all I had to do was,
like, roll my eyes,

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.234
'cause I was -- They were like,

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:57.234
"Oh, you've got
knight duty tonight."

00:03:57.234 --> 00:03:59.267
And I don't know kind of
what kind of came over me,

00:03:59.267 --> 00:04:03.167
but, like, I went into some
kind of facial spasm

00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:06.901
that, like, was really not what
the scene was supposed to be.

00:04:06.901 --> 00:04:08.767
And I thought,
"Well, you know what?

00:04:08.767 --> 00:04:10.200
I doubt that anyone's seen it.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.667
There were 53 cameras.
There's surely no way."

00:04:12.667 --> 00:04:15.968
And then I saw Miguel, who's,
like, the most astute director,

00:04:15.968 --> 00:04:18.834
kind of, like, trudge down
through like 155 extras.

00:04:18.834 --> 00:04:23.801
And he was like, "Fabien, what's
up with your face right now?"

00:04:23.801 --> 00:04:27.234
And I was like,
"What do you mean, Miguel?"

00:04:27.234 --> 00:04:30.834
-"What's up with your face?"
-In what way with it?

00:04:30.834 --> 00:04:32.634
I thought it was kind of --
that was right.

00:04:32.634 --> 00:04:35.334
That's how my face was --
-You weren't rolling your eyes.

00:04:35.334 --> 00:04:36.767
You were twitching or something.

00:04:36.767 --> 00:04:38.300
-He was like, "You were kind of
having some kind of

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.334
facial spasm."

00:04:39.334 --> 00:04:40.801
-Yeah.
-Which I was.

00:04:40.801 --> 00:04:42.133
-Yeah, and did you say,
"Look, I'm freaking out"?

00:04:42.133 --> 00:04:43.434
-I said,
"I'm having a full-blown --"

00:04:43.434 --> 00:04:46.100
Like, I feel now
is how I felt then.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.801
-Are you nervous to be here?
-Yeah.

00:04:47.801 --> 00:04:49.367
-No.
-Oh, my God.

00:04:49.367 --> 00:04:50.601
I did all the things.

00:04:50.601 --> 00:04:52.234
I, like, pulled up my socks,
'cause I was like,

00:04:52.234 --> 00:04:55.400
"Well, you don't want to show
kind of leg on 'Jimmy Fallon.'"

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.734
-No, we want to see your leg
on our show.

00:04:57.734 --> 00:05:01.000
Yeah, show every-- No.
-Yeah, I did all the things.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.367
-Oh, you're crushing it.

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:04.367
-Someone powdered me before I
kind of came on, yeah.

00:05:04.367 --> 00:05:06.467
-This is the first of many times
you'll be on our show.

00:05:06.467 --> 00:05:08.133
-Well, thank you, Jimmy.
Thank you so much.

00:05:08.133 --> 00:05:10.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
-I want to show a clip.

00:05:10.467 --> 00:05:12.934
Here's Fabien Frankel in
"House of the Dragon."

00:05:12.934 --> 00:05:14.133
Take a look at this.

00:05:18.834 --> 00:05:19.901
-Ooh!

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.601
[ Applause ]

00:05:48.367 --> 00:05:51.834
-Well done, my Prince.
Be winning tourneys in no time.

00:05:51.834 --> 00:05:53.100
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.534
Fabien Frankel, everyone.

00:05:55.534 --> 00:05:58.033
"House of the Dragon"
airs Sundays at 9:00 p.m.

00:05:58.033 --> 00:06:00.801
on HBO and
is streaming on HBO Max.

